&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;VD&lt;/b&gt; 15 m (10 &lt;abbr title=&quot;cases&quot;&gt;c&lt;/abbr&gt;) ; sprint
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Corps &#224; corps&lt;/b&gt; morsure, +6 (1d6+3 et &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Croc-En-Jambe.html&quot; title=&quot;croc-en-jambe&quot;&gt;croc-en-jambe&lt;/a&gt;), 2 griffes, +6 (1d3+3)
&lt;/div&gt;
